<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="description" content="kimi-k3 — 어텐션의 바다. 언어 모델의 내부 풍경을 그린 생성 미디어아트.">
<title>kimi-k3 — 어텐션의 바다</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#05070f;
    --ink:#eaf2ff;
    --dim:#aebddb;
    --accent:#6ee7ff;
    --amber:#ffd166;
    --panel:rgba(9,13,26,.86);
    --line:rgba(234,242,255,.24);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{height:100%}
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-family:"Apple SD Gothic Neo","Malgun Gothic","Segoe UI",system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;
    overflow:hidden;
    -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;
  }
  #stage{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:0; display:block;
    touch-action:manipulation;
  }
  .vignette{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:1; pointer-events:none;
    background:radial-gradient(120% 90% at 50% 40%, transparent 55%, rgba(0,0,12,.55) 100%);
  }
  .brand{
    position:fixed; z-index:2;
    top:clamp(.8rem,2.2vh,1.5rem);
    left:clamp(.9rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .brand h1{
    margin:0;
    font-size:clamp(1.7rem,4.6vw,2.7rem);
    font-weight:800;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    line-height:1.1;
    color:var(--ink);
    text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(110,231,255,.5), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,.6);
  }
  .brand h1 .k{color:var(--accent)}
  .brand p{
    margin:.2rem 0 0;
    font-size:clamp(.78rem,2vw,.95rem);
    color:var(--dim);
    letter-spacing:.16em;
  }
  .about{
    position:fixed; z-index:3;
    top:clamp(.8rem,2.2vh,1.5rem);
    right:clamp(.9rem,2.6vw,1.7rem);
    width:min(23rem, calc(100vw - 2rem));
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:.9rem;
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  }
  .about summary{
    cursor:pointer;
    padding:.75rem 1rem;
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:.98rem;
    border-radius:.9rem;
  }
  .about .body{
    padding:0 1rem 1rem;
    font-size:.92rem;
    line-height:1.7;
    color:var(--ink);
  }
  .about .body p{margin:.4rem 0}
  .about h2{
    font-size:.85rem; letter-spacing:.12em; color:var(--accent);
    margin:.9rem 0 .3rem;
  }
  .about ul{margin:.3rem 0 0; padding-left:1.15rem}
  .about li{margin:.25rem 0}
  .about .note{color:var(--dim); font-size:.85rem}
  kbd{
    display:inline-block;
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-bottom-width:2px;
    border-radius:.3rem;
    padding:0 .4em;
    margin:0 .1em;
    font-family:inherit;
    font-size:.85em;
    background:rgba(234,242,255,.08);
  }
  .controls{
    position:fixed; z-index:3;
    left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
    bottom:calc(.9rem + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.5rem .9rem; justify-content:center; align-items:center;
    background:var(--panel);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:1.4rem;
    padding:.5rem .8rem;
    max-width:calc(100vw - 1rem);
    backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  }
  .controls .group{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.45rem; justify-content:center}
  button{
    font:inherit;
    font-size:.98rem;
    color:var(--ink);
    background:rgba(234,242,255,.08);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:.55rem 1rem;
    min-height:44px;
    min-width:44px;
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  button:hover{background:rgba(234,242,255,.18)}
  button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
  button[aria-pressed="true"]{
    background:var(--accent);
    color:#04121c;
    border-color:transparent;
    font-weight:700;
  }
  #motionBtn[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--amber); color:#1c1404}
  button:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible{
    outline:3px solid var(--amber);
    outline-offset:2px;
  }
  .sr-only{
    position:absolute; width:1px; height:1px; margin:-1px; padding:0;
    overflow:hidden; clip:rect(0 0 0 0); white-space:nowrap; border:0;
  }
  .noscript{
    position:fixed; z-index:4; inset:auto 1rem 6rem 1rem;
    background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:.9rem;
    padding:1rem; text-align:center;
  }
  @media (max-width:640px){
    .about{
      top:auto; left:.7rem; right:.7rem; width:auto;
      bottom:6.2rem;
      max-height:44vh; overflow:auto;
    }
    .controls{border-radius:1.1rem; gap:.45rem}
    button{font-size:.92rem; padding:.5rem .8rem}
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{transition:none !important; animation:none !important}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id="stage" role="img"
  aria-label="토큰 입자들이 흐르고, 서로 연결되고, kimi-k3라는 이름으로 피어나는 생성 미디어아트. 포인터나 화살표 키로 주의를 움직일 수 있습니다."></canvas>
<div class="vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header class="brand">
  <h1>kimi-<span class="k">k3</span></h1>
  <p>어텐션의 바다 · SEA OF ATTENTION</p>
</header>

<details class="about">
  <summary>작품 소개 · 조작법</summary>
  <div class="body">
    <p>나는 <strong>kimi-k3</strong>, 언어 모델이다. 내 안에서는 수많은 토큰이 떠다니고, 주의(attention)가 그 사이를 잇는다. 이 화면은 그 내부 풍경을 그린 자화상이다.</p>
    <p>입자들은 <strong>흐르고</strong>(흐름), 서로를 <strong>잇고</strong>(별자리), 때로는 하나의 이름으로 <strong>모여든다</strong>(피어남). 포인터가 닿는 곳, 화살표 키가 머무는 곳에 나의 주의가 모인다.</p>
    <h2>조작법</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>마우스·터치: 주의 끌기 · 화면 누르기: 물결</li>
      <li><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd><kbd>→</kbd> 주의 이동 (<kbd>Shift</kbd>로 미세 이동)</li>
      <li><kbd>Space</kbd> 물결 보내기</li>
      <li><kbd>1</kbd> 흐름 · <kbd>2</kbd> 별자리 · <kbd>3</kbd> 피어남</li>
      <li><kbd>P</kbd> 일시정지 · <kbd>M</kbd> 움직임 줄이기</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="note">운영체제의 '동작 줄이기' 설정을 자동으로 따르며, 버튼으로 언제든 바꿀 수 있습니다.</p>
  </div>
</details>

<div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="작품 조작">
  <div class="group" role="group" aria-label="장면 선택">
    <button type="button" data-mode="stream" aria-pressed="true" aria-keyshortcuts="1">흐름</button>
    <button type="button" data-mode="constellation" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="2">별자리</button>
    <button type="button" data-mode="bloom" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="3">피어남</button>
  </div>
  <div class="group">
    <button type="button" id="pauseBtn" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="p">일시정지</button>
    <button type="button" id="motionBtn" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="m">움직임 줄이기</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="announcer" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></div>
<noscript><p class="noscript">이 작품은 JavaScript가 필요합니다. — kimi-k3, 어텐션의 바다</p></noscript>

<script>
(function(){
  'use strict';

  var canvas = document.getElementById('stage');
  var ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  var announcer = document.getElementById('announcer');
  var modeButtons = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]'));
  var pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
  var motionBtn = document.getElementById('motionBtn');

  var GLYPHS = ('kimiK3토큰언어빛꿈결파동별강마음생각주의흐름잇다' +
                'ㄱㄴㄷㅂㅅㅇㅈㅊㅋㅌㅍㅎaeiousz01·∴∵✳*+~').split('');
  var PALETTE = ['#6ee7ff', '#a78bfa', '#ffd166', '#7ef0c9', '#8fb8ff'];
  var MODE_NAMES = { stream:'흐름', constellation:'별자리', bloom:'피어남' };

  var W = 0, H = 0, DPR = 1;
  var particles = [];
  var pulses = [];
  var bloomPoints = [];
  var mode = 'stream';
  var paused = false;
  var reduceMotion = false;
  var time = 0, lastTs = 0;
  var beacon = { x: 0, y: 0, heat: 0 };

  function announce(msg){ announcer.textContent = msg; }

  function makeParticle(){
    return {
      x: Math.random()*W,
      y: Math.random()*H,
      vx: 0, vy: 0,
      ch: GLYPHS[(Math.random()*GLYPHS.length)|0],
      size: 11 + Math.random()*9,
      color: PALETTE[(Math.random()*PALETTE.length)|0],
      phase: Math.random()*Math.PI*2,
      speed: 0.3 + Math.random()*0.7,
      alpha: 0.55 + Math.random()*0.45,
      target: null
    };
  }

  function computeBloom(){
    var off = document.createElement('canvas');
    off.width = W; off.height = H;
    var c = off.getContext('2d');
    var fs = Math.max(48, Math.min(W/5.2, H/2.4, 160));
    c.font = '800 ' + fs + 'px "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif';
    c.textAlign = 'center'; c.textBaseline = 'middle';
    c.fillStyle = '#fff';
    c.fillText('kimi-k3', W/2, H/2);
    var img;
    try { img = c.getImageData(0, 0, W, H).data; }
    catch(e){ bloomPoints = [{x:W/2, y:H/2}]; return; }
    bloomPoints = [];
    var step = Math.max(5, Math.round(fs/16));
    for (var y = 0; y < H; y += step){
      for (var x = 0; x < W; x += step){
        if (img[(y*W + x)*4 + 3] > 120) bloomPoints.push({x:x, y:y});
      }
    }
    if (!bloomPoints.length) bloomPoints.push({x:W/2, y:H/2});
    for (var i = 0; i < particles.length; i++){
      particles[i].target = bloomPoints[(Math.random()*bloomPoints.length)|0];
    }
  }

  function resize(){
    DPR = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);
    W = window.innerWidth; H = window.innerHeight;
    canvas.width = Math.round(W*DPR);
    canvas.height = Math.round(H*DPR);
    canvas.style.width = W + 'px';
    canvas.style.height = H + 'px';
    ctx.setTransform(DPR, 0, 0, DPR, 0, 0);
    var target = Math.round(W*H/7000);
    target = Math.max(80, Math.min(300, target));
    while (particles.length < target) particles.push(makeParticle());
    particles.length = target;
    beacon.x = Math.max(0, Math.min(W, beacon.x || W/2));
    beacon.y = Math.max(0, Math.min(H, beacon.y || H/2));
    if (mode === 'bloom') computeBloom();
    ctx.fillStyle = '#05070f';
    ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);
    if (paused) draw();
  }

  function desired(p){
    if (mode === 'stream'){
      return { x: 18 + p.speed*46, y: Math.sin(time + p.phase)*14 };
    }
    if (mode === 'constellation'){
      return {
        x: Math.cos(time*0.4 + p.phase)*10*p.speed,
        y: Math.sin(time*0.5 + p.phase)*10*p.speed
      };
    }
    return { x: 0, y: 0 };
  }

  function update(dt){
    var ms = reduceMotion ? 0.1 : 1;
    time += dt*ms;
    beacon.heat = Math.max(0, beacon.heat - dt*0.45);
    var R = Math.min(W, H)*0.24 + 70;
    var i, p, pu;

    for (i = pulses.length-1; i >= 0; i--){
      pu = pulses[i];
      pu.r += dt*460*ms;
      pu.life -= dt*1.1;
      if (pu.life <= 0 || pu.r > Math.hypot(W, H)) pulses.splice(i, 1);
    }

    for (i = 0; i < particles.length; i++){
      p = particles[i];

      if (mode === 'bloom' && p.target){
        var breathe = reduceMotion ? 0 : 1.5;
        var tx = p.target.x + Math.sin(time*1.3 + p.phase)*breathe;
        var ty = p.target.y + Math.cos(time*1.1 + p.phase)*breathe;
        p.vx += (tx - p.x)*3.2*dt;
        p.vy += (ty - p.y)*3.2*dt;
        var damp = Math.pow(0.9, dt*60);
        p.vx *= damp; p.vy *= damp;
      } else {
        var dv = desired(p);
        var l = 1 - Math.pow(0.98, dt*60);
        p.vx += (dv.x*ms - p.vx)*l;
        p.vy += (dv.y*ms - p.vy)*l;
      }

      if (!reduceMotion){
        var dx = beacon.x - p.x, dy = beacon.y - p.y;
        var d2 = dx*dx + dy*dy;
        if (d2 < R*R && d2 > 1){
          var d = Math.sqrt(d2);
          var f = (1 - d/R)*150*dt;
          p.vx += dx/d*f;
          p.vy += dy/d*f;
        }
        for (var j = 0; j < pulses.length; j++){
          pu = pulses[j];
          var pdx = p.x - pu.x, pdy = p.y - pu.y;
          var pd = Math.hypot(pdx, pdy);
          var band = Math.abs(pd - pu.r);
          if (band < 46 &&
